{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370120","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1037012001:1":{"text":"You seem surprised.","source_cn":"你好像很惊讶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D38EE85BFE24D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037012002:1":{"text":"There's nothing to be surprised about. The flora in the forest constantly changes, and so do Misarte's people who live here.","source_cn":"这没什么好奇怪的。丛林的植被每时每刻都在枯荣转换，生活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0067020A16765966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037012003:1":{"text":"Eomir was handsome, wise, and kind when he was young. His virtues were constantly praised back then.","source_cn":"年轻时的伊米尔英俊睿智又善良，那时的丛林一直在传颂着他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F37AF28B98D7410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037012004:1":{"text":"But fallen leaves bury fragments of the past, both good and bad. Many things have changed.","source_cn":"可惜……落叶掩埋了许多，也改变了许多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6F2DC2BD316FBD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1037012005:1":{"text":"After all, how many of us can remain steadfast amidst the changing seasons?","source_cn":"说到底，又有几个人能在落叶里始终如一地过完一生呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41D2889272DEB12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民芙妮妮":{"text":"Fanny","source":"村民芙妮妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}